        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We don't eat meat often. When we do, I want it to be a quality cut.\nI haven't been disappointed so far. From prime rib roasts, to huge beef shortribs as in the pics I posted here. Great stuff.\nGood quality meats at fair prices.",
